EN:
How's it going, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}It's so cold out tonight, I hope my
brain doesn't freeze,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
Nasıl gidiyor, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Bu gece hava o kadar soğuk ki beynim
donmasa bari,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Schön, dass du da bist, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich hatte gar nicht mehr mit dir
gerechnet,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0011:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}HUCH!
Was taucht da aus dem Schnee auf?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Oh, das bist ja du!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du hast mich ganz schön erschreckt,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}! {{TAG:0005:0005:}}'daki bütün
karı yemeye mi geldin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Seni suçlayamam. Tadı bayağı güzel.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bana da biraz bırak ama, tamam mı,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
